---
import { site } from "../config";
---

<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-8 bg-paper-deep pb-16 pt-20 lg:pb-20 lg:pt-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2
        class="font-display text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,2.75rem)] font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.015em]"
      >
        About me
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        <p>
          {/* TODO: add one or two concrete specifics — the kinds of systems
              you've built, languages, industries, a problem you solved,
              where you're based. Specifics beat adjectives. */}
          I'm Tristan Barrow. I've spent ten years building software.
          Robur Ignis is my own practice, so the person on the intro call is the
          person you'll work with in every session.
        </p>
        <p>
          I use AI tools every day, and they've changed how fast I can build.
          They're also confidently wrong often enough that someone has to check
          the decisions that matter, like how users sign in or what happens when
          two requests arrive at once. Knowing where to look is most of what I
          teach.
        </p>
      </div>
      {/* TODO: add a scan of your real signature here (an SVG or transparent PNG). */}
    </div>

    <!-- The page's closing ask, set as a full-width ruled row. -->
    <div
      id="book"
      class="mt-16 flex scroll-mt-8 flex-col gap-6 border-t-2 border-ink pt-8 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"
    >
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium">Book a free 30-minute call</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-ink-soft">
          Tell me what you're building and where you're stuck. Or email{" "}
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="link">{site.email}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a href={site.bookingUrl} class="btn shrink-0">Choose a time</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
